hi I'm Evan Carmichael welcome to  another edition of ask Evan thank you  for joining me today I'm going to answer  question from one of my readers Allison  who asked me what the secrets of true  entrepreneur success is so that's a  bundle of a question I'll try to narrow  it down and keep this video pretty short  I'm going to share three things with you  that hopefully can help Alison and  everybody else is watching the first is  you got to start with the why so you  want to start a business that you're  really passionate about something that  you care deeply about and you feel you  can be able to help other people with  too many entrepreneurs start a business  because they think they can make a lot  of money and making money as part of  running a business but it's not the  reason to be in business you should want  to start a business because you you're  able to help people you feel you can add  a lot of value and you're really  passionate about what you're doing if  you look at any successful famous  entrepreneur you'll see that they served  the business because they really had a  strong desire to change the way things  were done in their industry it wasn't  about making a lot of money now making  money comes but it's not the main focus  so if you're certain business just to  make money I look at starting something  else look for a way to turn whatever  you're really passionate about where you  feel can help people into a business the  second thing I would do is try to model  success and when I was first getting  started I didn't know anything I was 19  years old running in my first you know  real business and I was overwhelmed  scared didn't know what to do and I then  you know the discovery came that you  know I'm not the first guy to try to do  what I'm trying to do right now these  others who have gone before me and  success leaves clues so I started  looking at successful entrepreneurs  we're in my industry who I could model  and that got me excited gave me ideas  and it also showed me that a lot of  these guys they started with nothing  they just had an idea and they had to  overcome huge obstacles to get to you  know where they eventually got to so it  gives me motivation as well to keep  going and eventual is able to build that  company up and sell it so look at people  who are in your industry who have  related products or services that you  can you know you look up to look at  other entrepreneurs who might  famous and you respect for different  reasons even if they have nothing to do  with your business so if you really like  Oprah Winfrey or Richard Branson or  whoever it is read their stories and how  they got started and look up to them and  try to model some of the things that  they did and apply to your business so  by modeling success be able to take what  may have taken somebody else years and a  lot of trial and error to figure out and  implement that into your business really  quickly and hopefully not make all the  same mistakes that they did to kind of  get to where they are so I'm a huge fan  of Mahlon success and the last bit of  advice that I want to leave you with  today is the amount that you'll make and  that's what a lot of entrepreneurs are  eventually looking for it how much money  am I going to make the amount you're  going to make is going to come down to  how much value provide so if you want to  make more money you have to provide more  value so think about the customers that  you're targeting think of how you can  help them and try to think of extra way  so you can go above and beyond to really  solve their problems if you need to make  more money provide more value and it's  basically as simple as that running a  business the entrepreneurs make money in  proportion to how much value they  provide to their customers so don't look  for you know cheap ways out of just  trying to grab as much money as you can  it's a short-term strategy to really  build a long-term successful business  you have to be able to provide a lot of  value to your customers and the morning  value provide then we are you going to  get paid so hopefully that helps if you  guys liked the video please give it a  thumbs up I always appreciate those when  I see them coming in and I'd love to  hear we have to think if you want to  leave a comment under the video so thank  you and stay tuned for next episode  you
 

